</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00002/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一个指甲剪，在其底部刻有“一劳永逸”字样。当按照常规指甲剪的用法来使用该项目时，被其剪除的指甲将在此后永远停止生长。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/4/1<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>████市场<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>收容于Site-CN-75<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>人总是在失去的时候才会追悔莫及。啊淦，我开始想念我那永远回不来的完美长指甲了，主要是短指甲挠痒痒真尼玛难受。我特么当初为什么要用这玩意剪得这么短啊啊啊！——特工Astra</em></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00002" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00002" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00002-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/universe647" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4376536); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4376536&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607437712" alt=" Universe647" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4376536)" /></a> <a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/universe647" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4376536); return false;">Universe647</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1585674899 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">31 Mar 2020 17:14</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00068/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一盘石磨，材质为石膏，上面雕刻有一个投币口和一句话“收件人：阴间礼部张书吏”，投进去一角钱，就会自动转三分钟。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>██省石料厂<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>放置于Site-CN-██的休息室中，允许员工投币自磨豆浆。投进去的硬币将作为捐赠款。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>“有钱能使鬼推磨。”这话一点也不假，哼，这玩意儿一定是鬼造的</em>——Dr.shadeoi<br />
<em>我们喝豆浆都喝吐了，所以我们不会再投币了，不会！</em>——特工EVIL</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00068" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00068" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00068-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/steven-the-shadow" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6316800); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6316800&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607437712" alt="Steven the shadow" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6316800)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/steven-the-shadow" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6316800); return false;">Steven the shadow</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1587022723 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">16 Apr 2020 07:38</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00432/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一架施坦威C-227型黑色三角钢琴，其琴身上的“Steinway”标志与竖琴商标被以相同工艺制作的“劣质产品®”字样代替。当其周围7×7m范围内存在其他品牌的钢琴/电子琴/电钢琴/双排键时，若范围内有人类试图弹奏其他品牌的钢琴/电子琴/电钢琴/双排键时，其会以██m/s的速度冲向该乐器并持续直线行进2~█km，行进时经过的地面将受到█吨的压力。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/10/2<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>广东某乐器商店<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>收容于Site-CN-82异常物品仓库内，其异常效应影响范围内不允许放置任何相同或相似类型异常物品。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>“<em>就是这东西撞烂了你的KAWAI K800s顺便还在站点外面硬生生压出条路来？？”——Dr.Shadowpen</em><br />
<em>“血赚不亏。”Dr.Gaster</em></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00432" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00432" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00432-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gaster-master" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3398699); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3398699&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607437712" alt="Gaster Master" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3398699)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gaster-master" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3398699); return false;">Gaster Master</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1602044867 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">07 Oct 2020 04:27</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00255/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">15</span>14瓶2000毫升喷雾，在被吸入后吸入者将会被移除一段时间█分钟到██天的令人痛苦的回忆。瓶身正面写着：<br />
<strong><em>您还在为一件只有您自己知道的不堪回首的记忆发愁吗？<br />
您还在思考如何抚平朋友心中的创伤吗？<br />
现在拨打电话███████6079，您只需花███.██元就能买到████████牌神奇喷雾了！</em></strong><br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>██市一家大受好评的心理诊所。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>放在SITE-CN-81员工休息室供员工取用。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>请求仿制此种喷雾剂供机动特遣队使用。——特工Kardi<br />
批准。——SITE-CN-81主管███</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00255" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00255" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00255-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zeta-9-beta" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6441401); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6441401&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607437712" alt="zeta-9-beta" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6441401)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zeta-9-beta" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6441401); return false;">zeta-9-beta</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1591945907 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">12 Jun 2020 07:11</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00335/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<strong>项目描述：</strong>一行带有模因的文字，会使观察者产生极度反感并拒绝记忆位于与项目之前的内容。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>各类书籍<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>未被完全收容<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">以下为一个典型范例</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">收起</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<h3><span>要求全文背诵</span></h3>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00335" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00335" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00335-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leeeeeeoooooo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6158338); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6158338&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607437712" alt="LEEEEEEOOOOOO" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6158338)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leeeeeeoooooo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6158338); return false;">LEEEEEEOOOOOO</a></span></p>
